# A session's agent stops with a shell still running in the background, while the user
# is away. Telegram gets the Ready message as before: Copilot takes a message in that
# state, so the session is reachable from the phone. A reply from the phone goes
# straight in, with no "queued" detour, because waiting on a shell is not working. When
# the shell finishes, the agent's follow-up turn is a new cycle: its end sends a second
# Ready carrying what that turn said, not the message from before the shell.
#
# Driven in the hooks regime, which is what runs on a real machine.

size 110x30
arg --mux
fake_telegram private
session alpha Training session

wait_for Training session
press enter
wait_for Fake Copilot is idling

# A turn that leaves a backgrounded job running, then the agent stops. The ready hook
# lands after we are back at the list, which is what makes its end an attention event.
type e2e:hook working
press enter
wait_for ran the working hook
type e2e:shell fits-inference
press enter
wait_for left shell fits-inference running
type e2e:work 1000 Started the training run; it is still going in the background.
press enter
wait_for finished a turn
type e2e:hook ready 1500
press enter
press ctrl+b d
wait_for Training session

telegram_wait message: <b>(Training session)</b>
telegram_wait Started the training run; it is still going in the background.
telegram_dump 01-ready-with-shell-outstanding
dump 01-list

# A reply while the agent waits on its shell: delivered at once, thumbs-up on the phone.
telegram_say How far along is it?
wait 3000
telegram_expect_not Queued
press enter
wait_for Fake Copilot received: How far along is it?
telegram_wait reaction on
wait_for on background shell fits-inference
dump 02-reply-in-while-waiting
telegram_dump 02-reply-delivered

# The job finishes: the notice wakes the agent, whose follow-up turn ends while we are
# away again. The phone hears about this turn, with this turn's words.
type e2e:shell_done fits-inference
press enter
wait_for heard shell fits-inference finish
wait 800
wait_gone on background shell
type e2e:work 1000 Training finished: accuracy 0.93 on the held-out set.
press enter
wait_for finished a turn
type e2e:hook ready 1500
press enter
press ctrl+b d
wait_for Training session

telegram_wait Training finished: accuracy 0.93 on the held-out set.
telegram_dump 03-ready-after-follow-up
dump 03-list-after-follow-up
